6 0 obj << /Length 287 >> stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 50 720 Td (I am happy to join with you today in what will go down in history as the greatest demonstration for freedom in the history of our nation. Five score years ago, a great American, in whose symbolic shadow we stand today, signed the Emancipation Proclamation.) Tj ET
